    },
    {
      "original_text": "Each existing forbidden-action HARD-GATE in brainstorm, sprint, fix-bug, and implementation-plan SKILL.md is enumerated and mapped to a (skill, phase, forbidden-tool-or-action) tuple consumed by the hook.",
      "original_section": "SC",
      "classification": {
        "label": "end-state",
